{
  "meta": {
    "package": "BIOA_STA60_08A_CIN.pcc",
    "stem": "BIOA_STA60_08A_CIN",
    "textLang": "INT",
    "sets": 1
  },
  "entries": [
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_08A_CIN|sta60_garrus_doctor_D|105063",
      "en": "I didn't tell anyone. I swear!",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_08A_CIN|sta60_garrus_doctor_D|105064",
      "en": "That was smart, Doc.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_08A_CIN|sta60_garrus_doctor_D|105065",
      "en": "I couldn't find the proof I needed in my investigation. But I knew what was really going on. Saren's a traitor to the Council, and a disgrace to my people!",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_08A_CIN|sta60_garrus_doctor_D|105066",
      "en": "Fist is going to be waiting for us. When we hit him, we better hit him hard.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_08A_CIN|sta60_garrus_doctor_D|105067",
      "en": "You know, we aren't the only ones going after Fist. The Shadow Broker hired a krogan bounty hunter named Wrex to take him out.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_08A_CIN|sta60_garrus_doctor_D|105068",
      "en": "Yeah, we saw him in the bar.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_08A_CIN|sta60_garrus_doctor_D|105069",
      "en": "Last I heard, he was at the C-Sec Academy.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_08A_CIN|sta60_garrus_doctor_D|105070",
      "en": "What's he doing there?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_08A_CIN|sta60_garrus_doctor_D|105071",
      "en": "Fist accused him of making threats. We brought Wrex in for a little talk. If you hurry, you can catch him at the academy before he leaves.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_08A_CIN|sta60_garrus_doctor_D|105072",
      "en": "Now, if Garrus comes around, you stay smart. Keep your mouth shut or we'll--",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_08A_CIN|sta60_garrus_doctor_D|105073",
      "en": "Let her go!",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_08A_CIN|sta60_garrus_doctor_D|105074",
      "en": "Freeze, Garrus! One false move and I--",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_08A_CIN|sta60_garrus_doctor_D|105075",
      "en": "Who are you?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_08A_CIN|sta60_garrus_doctor_D|105076",
      "en": "Argh!",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_08A_CIN|sta60_garrus_doctor_D|105077",
      "en": "Ahh!",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_08A_CIN|sta60_garrus_doctor_D|105078",
      "en": "Perfect timing, Shepard. Gave me a clear shot at that bastard.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_08A_CIN|sta60_garrus_doctor_D|105079",
      "en": "There wasn't time to think! I just reacted. I didn't mean to-- Dr. Michel? Are you hurt?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_08A_CIN|sta60_garrus_doctor_D|105080",
      "en": "Sometimes you get lucky.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_08A_CIN|sta60_garrus_doctor_D|105081",
      "en": "Dr. Michel? Are you hurt?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_08A_CIN|sta60_garrus_doctor_D|105082",
      "en": "No. I'm okay. Thanks to you. All of you.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_08A_CIN|sta60_garrus_doctor_D|105083",
      "en": "They work for Fist. They wanted to shut me up, keep me from telling Garrus about the quarian.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_08A_CIN|sta60_garrus_doctor_D|105084",
      "en": "I think it might. Dr. Michel, tell us what happened.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_08A_CIN|sta60_garrus_doctor_D|105085",
      "en": "A few days ago, a quarian came by my office. She'd been shot, but she wouldn't tell me who did it. I could tell she was scared, probably on the run.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_08A_CIN|sta60_garrus_doctor_D|105086",
      "en": "She asked me about the Shadow Broker. She wanted to trade information in exchange for a safe place to hide.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_08A_CIN|sta60_garrus_doctor_D|105087",
      "en": "I put her in contact with Fist. He's an agent for the Shadow Broker.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_08A_CIN|sta60_garrus_doctor_D|105088",
      "en": "Not any more. Now he works for Saren, and the Shadow Broker isn't too happy about it. ",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_08A_CIN|sta60_garrus_doctor_D|105089",
      "en": "Fist betrayed the Shadow Broker? That's stupid, even for him. Saren must have made him quite the offer.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_08A_CIN|sta60_garrus_doctor_D|105090",
      "en": "That quarian must have something Saren wants. Something worth crossing the Shadow Broker to get.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_08A_CIN|sta60_garrus_doctor_D|105091",
      "en": "I'm not sure. Like I said, she wanted to trade information for a place to hide. She didn't... wait a minute! Geth. Her information had something to do with the geth!",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_08A_CIN|sta60_garrus_doctor_D|105092",
      "en": "She did! The information she was going to trade. She said it had something to do with the geth.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_08A_CIN|sta60_garrus_doctor_D|105093",
      "en": "She must be able to link Saren to the geth. There's no way the Council can ignore this!",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_08A_CIN|sta60_garrus_doctor_D|105094",
      "en": "This is your show, Shepard. But I want to bring Saren down as much as you do. I'm coming with you!",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_08A_CIN|sta60_garrus_doctor_D|105095",
      "en": "All turians are not the same. I'm not like Saren.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_08A_CIN|sta60_garrus_doctor_D|105103",
      "en": "What were you thinking? You could've hit the hostage!",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_08A_CIN|sta60_garrus_doctor_D|105105",
      "en": "You took him down clean.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_08A_CIN|sta60_garrus_doctor_D|105107",
      "en": "Glad I could help.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_08A_CIN|sta60_garrus_doctor_D|105109",
      "en": "I know those men threatened you. But if you tell us who they work for, we can protect you.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_08A_CIN|sta60_garrus_doctor_D|105110",
      "en": "Why were they threatening you? Who do they work for?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_08A_CIN|sta60_garrus_doctor_D|105111",
      "en": "Does this have anything to do with the investigation into Saren?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_08A_CIN|sta60_garrus_doctor_D|105113",
      "en": "What quarian?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_08A_CIN|sta60_garrus_doctor_D|105115",
      "en": "Where is she now?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_08A_CIN|sta60_garrus_doctor_D|105116",
      "en": "Then what?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_08A_CIN|sta60_garrus_doctor_D|105120",
      "en": "What else can you tell me about the quarian?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_08A_CIN|sta60_garrus_doctor_D|105122",
      "en": "She must have something that proves he's a traitor. Did the quarian mention anything about Saren? Or the geth?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_08A_CIN|sta60_garrus_doctor_D|105124",
      "en": "Time we paid Fist a visit.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_08A_CIN|sta60_garrus_doctor_D|105125",
      "en": "You're a turian. Why do you want to bring him down?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_08A_CIN|sta60_garrus_doctor_D|105126",
      "en": "I don't need a turian shooting me in the back when I least expect it.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_08A_CIN|sta60_garrus_doctor_D|105128",
      "en": "You can come along, but I'll be watching you!",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_08A_CIN|sta60_garrus_doctor_D|105129",
      "en": "Welcome aboard, Garrus.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_08A_CIN|sta60_garrus_doctor_D|105132",
      "en": "A krogan might come in handy.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_08A_CIN|sta60_garrus_doctor_D|105135",
      "en": "Move out.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_08A_CIN|sta60_garrus_doctor_D|105136",
      "en": "We can handle this on our own. Let's go.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_08A_CIN|sta60_garrus_doctor_D|105144",
      "en": "It was a big risk.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_08A_CIN|sta60_garrus_doctor_D|105145",
      "en": "Nice shot.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_08A_CIN|sta60_garrus_doctor_D|105146",
      "en": "No problem.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_08A_CIN|sta60_garrus_doctor_D|105150",
      "en": "We can protect you.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_08A_CIN|sta60_garrus_doctor_D|105151",
      "en": "Tell me what happened.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_08A_CIN|sta60_garrus_doctor_D|105152",
      "en": "Who were those men?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_08A_CIN|sta60_garrus_doctor_D|105153",
      "en": "What about Saren?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_08A_CIN|sta60_garrus_doctor_D|105154",
      "en": "Quarian?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_08A_CIN|sta60_garrus_doctor_D|105157",
      "en": "Where'd she go?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_08A_CIN|sta60_garrus_doctor_D|105158",
      "en": "Go on.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_08A_CIN|sta60_garrus_doctor_D|105162",
      "en": "Anything else?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_08A_CIN|sta60_garrus_doctor_D|105163",
      "en": "Evidence.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_08A_CIN|sta60_garrus_doctor_D|105166",
      "en": "We need to find her!",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_08A_CIN|sta60_garrus_doctor_D|105167",
      "en": "We don't have anything yet.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_08A_CIN|sta60_garrus_doctor_D|105168",
      "en": "But Fist has her!",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_08A_CIN|sta60_garrus_doctor_D|105169",
      "en": "Why do you hate Saren?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_08A_CIN|sta60_garrus_doctor_D|105170",
      "en": "Forget it.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_08A_CIN|sta60_garrus_doctor_D|105171",
      "en": "Okay.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_08A_CIN|sta60_garrus_doctor_D|105173",
      "en": "You made your case.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_08A_CIN|sta60_garrus_doctor_D|105174",
      "en": "I still don't trust you.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_08A_CIN|sta60_garrus_doctor_D|105177",
      "en": "We could use him.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_08A_CIN|sta60_garrus_doctor_D|105178",
      "en": "We don't need him.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_08A_CIN|sta60_garrus_doctor_D|105181",
      "en": "Let's go.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_08A_CIN|sta60_garrus_doctor_D|105230",
      "en": "They work for Fist. They wanted to shut me up, keep me from telling Garrus about the quarian.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_08A_CIN|sta60_garrus_doctor_D|105231",
      "en": "The one I told you about, Shepard.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_08A_CIN|sta60_garrus_doctor_D|105232",
      "en": "Just like Wrex told us, Commander.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_08A_CIN|sta60_garrus_doctor_D|105233",
      "en": "Just like Wrex told us, Commander.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_08A_CIN|sta60_garrus_doctor_D|111641",
      "en": "Yeah, we heard about him.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_08A_CIN|sta60_garrus_doctor_D|163999",
      "en": "Let her go!",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_08A_CIN|sta60_garrus_doctor_D|164000",
      "en": "Let her go.",
      "tr": ""
    }
  ]
}